---
Title: Peanut Butter Goo
Tags: Sweet Shack
---

Add to a #large bowl{}:
- @Cottage Cheese{1.5 cup}
- @Peanut Butter{8 Tablespoons}
- @Maple Syrup{4 Tablespoons}
- @Vanilla{2 Tablespoons}

Emulsify the ingredients in the bowl.

Add to the bowl @Almond Flour{3 cups}

Place into container and refrigerate 

